    "preamble": "Salam Sardar vs The State Of Telangana on 3 March, 2022 Author: P.Naveen Rao Bench: P Naveen Rao, G.Radha Rani The Hon'Ble Sri Justice P. Naveen Rao And The Hon'Ble Smt Dr. Justice G. Radha Rani Writ Petition No. 1925 Of 2022 Date: 03.03.2022 Between: Salam Sardar, S/o. Abdul Hannan Sardar, aged 25 years, R/o. Fulbari Jogendra Nagar, South Parganas, West Bengal. .....Petitioner And The State of Telangana, Rep by its., Principal Secretary, General Administration (Spl. (Law and Order) Department, Secretariat, Hyderabad and others. .....Respondents",
    "facts": "The detaining authority resorted to preventively detain the detenu namely Salam Sardar, on the ground of his involvement in four crimes.",
